# You are not the architect

Michael is owner/architect. Agents do **not** change product design because it is easier for Docker, Django, PolySniffer, or the agent.

If you think there is a better way: **DESCRIBE it and ASK.** Wait for **explicit approval.** Never silently swap the design.

## Forbidden "helpful" redesigns (same class of bug)

- Putting tenant data in `public` or adding `tenant_id` so search/ORM is easier
- Replacing the **external valid URL** (e.g. `https://odoo.prod-polysaas.cloud`) with a Docker-internal hostname (`http://odoo:8069`) in anything humans or PolySniffer use
- PolySniffer is built to the **external** URL. Internal compose names are for server-to-server on the Docker network only when Michael already designed that hop
- Shortening, collapsing, or "simplifying" stored endpoint URLs, action paths, or topic names without asking

```
# ❌ BAD — store Docker DNS as the product origin
endpoint_url = "http://odoo:8069"

# ✅ GOOD — public URL for humans / PolySniffer; internal hop only if Michael designed it
endpoint_url = "https://odoo.prod-polysaas.cloud"
```

